hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"23586","Ibn Abi Adi narrated to us, from Muhammad ibn Ishaq, from Sulayman ibn Suhaym, from his mother, the daughter of Abu al-Hakam al-Ghifari, she said: I heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, say: A man draws near to Paradise until there is only a cubit between him and it, then he speaks a word and becomes farther from it than Sanaa."
